                <mxCell id="n32" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;If step 5, 6 or 7 fails or times out, the saga retries with backoff and then compensates (releases the reservation or reverses the debit) and publishes TransferFailed; unresolved cases go to a manual-operations queue.&lt;br&gt;A reconciliation job compares the service&#39;s records with Core and interbank settlement reports.&lt;br&gt;Own-account transfers complete in the Core without steps 6 and 7." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=light-dark(#333333,#EAEAEA);" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="480" width="900" height="150" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="n33" value="&lt;b&gt;Key&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Numbers show the order of interactions. Grey: synchronous call. Dashed blue: asynchronous event. Orange: call to an external system. Green: authentication. Steps with the same number and a letter happen in alternative branches." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=light-dark(#333333,#EAEAEA);" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="1200" width="1700" height="50" as="geometry"/>
